---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import H from "@/components/H.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
import List from "@/components/List.astro";
import StatGrid from "@/components/StatGrid.astro";
import tammyDennis from "@/images/2026/tammy-dennis.jpeg";
import westShoreScrimmage from "@/images/2026/west-shore-fll-scrimmage.jpg";
---

<Layout
    title="Outreach"
    description="Learn how Team V.A.N. connects students with community leaders, educators, engineers, and STEM opportunities across Central Florida."
>
    <H>Outreach</H>

    <Section aria-labelledby="why-outreach-heading">
        <H id="why-outreach-heading" level="h2">
            Why Outreach Matters
        </H>
        <p>
            FRC teams are judged on how well they spread STEM and FIRST's values
            in their community, not just on match wins. For us, outreach also
            means introducing the program itself to a part of Florida that
            doesn't have an established FRC presence yet: hosting tours at
            competitions, mentoring younger FIRST LEGO League (FLL) teams, and
            talking with local leaders about what hands-on robotics can do for
            students here.
        </p>
    </Section>

    <Section aria-labelledby="community-leadership-heading">
        <H id="community-leadership-heading" level="h2">
            Community Leadership & Advocacy
        </H>
        <details class="rounded-base border border-white/20 bg-white/5">
            <summary class="showdown-summary cursor-pointer p-4 font-semibold">
                Space Coast Showdown
            </summary>
            <div class="space-y-4 px-4 pb-4">
                <p>
                    <strong>September 26, 2026</strong> — Valiant Air Command
                    Warbird Museum:{" "}
                    <a
                        class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4"
                        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/7Jz1C8Vz5oYsiKVJ9"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >
                        6600 Tico Rd, Titusville, FL
                    </a>
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our team had an extremely successful day volunteering at the
                    Space Coast Showdown! In addition to keeping matches running
                    smoothly as field resetters in the morning hours of the
                    competition, our members proudly served as ambassadors for
                    Team V.A.N. and FIRST Florida, engaging with NASA employees,
                    Eastern Florida State College (EFSC) directors, and school
                    board member candidates.
                </p>
                <p class="mb-0">
                    At the Space Coast Showdown, Team V.A.N. invited and hosted
                    guided tours for community leaders, educational advocates,
                    and industry professionals. We talked about what it's like
                    to be a rookie FRC team and how hands-on STEM through FIRST
                    reaches local youth across Brevard:
                </p>
                <figure class="my-6">
                    <Image
                        src={tammyDennis}
                        alt="Team V.A.N. members talking with Tammy Dennis at the Space Coast Showdown"
                        class="h-auto w-full rounded-base border border-silver object-cover"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                    <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm">
                        Team V.A.N. members introduce District 5 school board
                        candidate Tammy Dennis to the FIRST Robotics Competition
                        program and show her the competition at Space Coast
                        Showdown on Saturday, Sept. 26.
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 mb-6">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Tammy Dennis</strong> (Brevard District 5 School
                        Board Candidate) — Toured our setup and expressed strong
                        support for the FIRST vision and the expansion of
                        robotics programs across Brevard County schools. Viewed
                        and interacted with most Brevard teams.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Gordon B. Coffey</strong> (NASA Mechanical
                        Engineer) — Enthusiastically viewed Florida teams'
                        robots and offered to connect Team V.A.N. with
                        professional engineering networks across Florida,
                        including contacts at aerospace leaders like Lockheed
                        Martin.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Daniel Mondshein</strong> (Eastern Florida State
                        College Collegewide Chair) — Toured with our members and
                        offered full access to EFSC resources, to the best of
                        his ability, to support our students' technical
                        development and post-secondary STEM pathways.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-base border border-white/20 bg-white/5">
            <summary class="showdown-summary cursor-pointer p-4 font-semibold">
                West Shore FLL Scrimmage
            </summary>
            <div class="px-4 pb-4">
                <p class="mb-4">
                    This October, Team V.A.N. enjoyed volunteering to help run an
                    FLL scrimmage in Brevard County. Our members served as
                    referees and judges while helping with event setup and
                    teardown to make sure everything ran smoothly.
                </p>
                <figure>
                    <Image
                        src={westShoreScrimmage}
                        alt="Students gathered around an FLL robotics field at the West Shore FLL Scrimmage"
                        class="h-auto w-full rounded-base border border-silver object-cover"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                </figure>
                <p class="mt-4">
                    We were so impressed by how much these elementary school
                    students were able to prepare for competition in just a
                    couple months. It was heartwarming to see several teams we’ve
                    mentored succeeding at competition. We’re proud to support
                    the next generation of robotics students and help grow STEM
                    opportunities in our community. We wish all of these teams
                    good luck at qualifiers!
                </p>
            </div>
        </details>
    </Section>

    <Section aria-labelledby="fll-competitions-heading">
        <H id="fll-competitions-heading" level="h2">
            Upcoming FLL Events
        </H>
        <List>
            <li>
                <p>
                    <strong>FLL Challenge Scrimmage (Pinellas)</strong> —
                    October 17, 2026
                </p>
                <p class="pl-4">
                    Azalea Middle School:{" "}
                    <a
                        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/FEYV6Uz1gfULo1XdA"
                        class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >
                        7855 22nd Ave N., St. Petersburg, FL
                    </a>
                </p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>
                    <strong>FLL Challenge Scrimmage (Lake)</strong> — October
                    24, 2026
                </p>
                <p class="pl-4">
                    Montverde Academy:{" "}
                    <a
                        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/RttnUE39cU8JfbF98"
                        class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >
                        17235 7th St, Montverde, FL
                    </a>
                </p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>
                    <strong>FLL Challenge Scrimmage (Hillsborough)</strong> —
                    October 24, 2026
                </p>
                <p class="pl-4">
                    Corbett Preparatory School:{" "}
                    <a
                        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/K9wdUbZsbcURHPYp7"
                        class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >
                        12015 Orange Grove Drive, Tampa, FL
                    </a>
                </p>
            </li>
        </List>
    </Section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .showdown-summary {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        list-style: none;
    }

    .showdown-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
    }

    .showdown-summary::before {
        width: 0;
        height: 0;
        margin-right: 0.6rem;
        border-top: 4px solid transparent;
        border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
        border-left: 6px solid currentColor;
        content: "";
        transition: transform 150ms ease;
    }

    details[open] > .showdown-summary::before {
        transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
</style>
